# Docs site generator. The single input for requirements.txt next to it,
# which is what CI and `make docs` actually install (hash-pinned,
# --require-hashes). Lives under hack/ rather than docs/ because zensical
# copies every non-Markdown file in docs/ into the published site.
# Bump the version here, then regenerate the lock:
#   make docs-lock
zensical==0.0.50
